OL,3,GNEWSATeen born without hair won't leave
OL,4,Ahome without wigs - now NHS has slashed
OL,5,Afunding
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 13-year-old who was born without hair
OL,8,Fhas been told she will no longer
OL,9,Freceive vouchers for the specialist
OL,10,Fwigs she's worn since she was three.
OL,12,FMum Ceri said Kizzi-Rae's hair "grows
OL,13,Flike fluff and then disappears", and
OL,14,Ftwo specialist wigs per year cost
OL,15,F#1,250 each, for which she receives
OL,16,Ffunding.
OL,18,FBut Kizzi-Rae was referred back to her
OL,19,Flocal hospital from Salford Royal after
OL,20,Fa review led to patients living outside
OL,21,Fthe area being transitioned back to
OL,22,Ftheir area's healthcare providers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
